      "description": "The Ascenty Hortolândia Campus, located in Hortolândia, Brazil, is a major data center campus comprising multiple operational and under-development facilities. The campus provides 85MW of power capacity and 602,000 square feet of data center space.\n\nDesigned for high availability and long-term scalability, the campus incorporates redundancy across all critical infrastructure systems, including power, cooling, and network connectivity. It operates as a carrier-neutral campus, offering dedicated telecom meet-me rooms and direct connectivity to major Internet exchange points and leading cloud providers.\n\nSecurity features include 24/7 CCTV monitoring and dual-authentication access control. Operated by Ascenty, a Digital Realty and Brookfield company, the campus is part of one of Latin America's largest data center platforms, with facilities across Brazil, Chile, and Mexico.",
